amage and pulls one ordinary enemy at most8 swept pixels. Bosses cannot be pulled. Only tagged loads can be reeled in field puzzles.","field_caps":["reel_load"]},{"id":14,"name":"Shuttle Span","phase":"wood","handler":"shuttle_span","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Set a short visible thread between two authored endpoints for at most60 updates;24 Q4 once per enemy per cast. Every segment and target must have line of sight.","field_caps":["reel_load"]},{"id":15,"name":"Heat Pocket","phase":"fire","handler":"heat_pocket","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"Place one visible stationary heat patch that bursts after18 updates for24 Q4 once per enemy; maximum lifetime48. Field heat charges affect only tagged receptacles.","field_caps":["store_heat"]},{"id":16,"name":"Firing Drawer","phase":"fire","handler":"firing_drawer","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Move a stored heat patch between two short visible positions before its arrival burst,24 Q4 once per enemy. Maximum lifetime60; never crosses unmarked walls or ignites from phase alone.","field_caps":["store_heat"]},{"id":17,"name":"Washback","phase":"water","handler":"washback","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"A short frontal surge deals24 Q4 and pushes ordinary enemies at most10 swept pixels. No boss displacement. Buoy only explicitly tagged dock loads.","field_caps":["float_load"]},{"id":18,"name":"Wake Turn","phase":"water","handler":"wake_turn","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"A telegraphed L-shaped surge travels at most48 pixels across two orthogonal segments,24 Q4 once per enemy. Check walls on every segment and target; pivot only marked floating loads.","field_caps":["float_load"]},{"id":19,"name":"Counterdrop","phase":"earth","handler":"counterdrop","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"Place a visible small Earth impact that lands after18 updates for24 Q4 once per enemy. Press only authored counterweight pans; manual weights remain a mandatory-route alternative.","field_caps":["press_weight"]},{"id":20,"name":"Counterpoise