well"]},{"id":27,"name":"Lens Dart","phase":"water","handler":"lens_dart","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"Narrow Water bead splits into two outward rays only on its first target impact: initial 16 Q4, secondary 8 Q4. Initial target cannot be hit again; rays respect walls.","field_caps":["refract_beam"]},{"id":28,"name":"Prism Wake","phase":"water","handler":"prism_wake","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"One short-lived visible line splits the next eligible ordinary hostile shot into two harmless outward droplets, then ends. Endpoint Water burst is 24 Q4; one line and one consumed shot, no recycling.","field_caps":["refract_beam"]},{"id":29,"name":"Ember Hush","phase":"fire","handler":"ember_hush","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"One visible warm mark lengthens an ordinary enemy's next attack windup, then pops for 16 Q4 Fire. Boss telegraphs are not retimed; one mark and finite expiry.","field_caps":["store_heat"]},{"id":30,"name":"Bellows Ring","phase":"fire","handler":"bellows_ring","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Visible expanding Fire annulus with an empty safe center, 24 Q4 once per target at its edge. One bounded ring; respects obstacles.","field_caps":["store_heat"]},{"id":31,"name":"Sideguard","phase":"earth","handler":"sideguard","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"Brace a narrow flank for one ordinary melee hit and reply with a 16 Q4 Earth swipe. Front and rear remain exposed; no general invulnerability.","field_caps":["press_weight"]},{"id":32,"name":"Vault Step","phase":"earth","handler":"vault_step","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Move a narrow guard to one of two explicitly selected side positions, producing a 24 Q4 lateral wave after interception. One eligible hit; visible vulnerable sides remain.","field_caps":["press_weight"]},{"id":33,"name":"Pinch Window","phase":"metal","handler":"pinch_window","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"Catch one marked ordinary melee strike in a narrow frontal arc and reply with a 24 Q4 Metal pin. Clear startup, no instant universal parry; boss windows remain unchanged.","field_caps":["tune_latch"]},{"id":34,"name":"Shear Gate","phase":"metal","handler":"shear_gate","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Place two visible facing blades for one short crossing window; crossing target receives 24 Q4 once. One gate maximum and bounded lifetime; existing boss vulnerability rules apply.","field_caps":["tune_latch"]},{"id":35,"name":"Sapling Feint","phase":"wood","handler":"sapling_feint","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"One brief grounded decoy diverts one eligible ordinary enemy approach, then folds. No boss taunt, player teleport or invulnerability.","field_caps":["reel_load"]},{"id":36,"name":"Canopy Exchange","phase":"wood","handler":"canopy_exchange","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Two short-lived decoys with a visible connecting line redirect one eligible approach toward the safer endpoint. A 16 Q4 Wood snap only after activation; no teleport or invulnerability.","field_caps":["reel_load"]},{"id":37,"name":"Rill Fork","phase":"water","handler":"rill_fork","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"Short Y-shaped Water fork, 12 Q4 per branch with one hit cap per target and a small slowing effect. Bounded segments respect walls; no player pull.","field_caps":["reveal_current","fill_basin"]},{"id":38,"name":"Veil Curl","phase":"water","handler":"veil_curl","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Clearly drawn Water crescent with a gap catches side approaches for 24 Q4 once. Escape lane remains open, walls block the curl and the player is never pulled.","field_caps":["reveal_current","fill_basin"]},{"id":39,"name":"Warm Echo","phase":"fire","handler":"warm_echo","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"Mark one visible target for the next ordinary weapon hit, triggering one delayed 16 Q4 Fire follow-up. One mark and short expiry prevent stockpiling; no through-wall targeting.","field_caps":["ignite"]},{"id":40,"name":"Paired Echo","phase":"fire","handler":"paired_echo","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Link two separately aimed target marks. Striking one triggers a weak follow-up on the other only with line of sight; total 24 Q4 budget, no chains, friendly fire or through-wall targeting.","field_caps":["ignite"]},{"id":41,"name":"Needle Bank","phase":"metal","handler":"needle_bank","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"One Metal spine with one wall ricochet and a visible reflection. Swept segments, 20 Q4 maximum once per target; no extra bounces.","field_caps":["draw_ore"]},{"id":42,"name":"Quill Return","phase":"metal","handler":"quill_return","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Three-spine fan retracts along the creature's current unobstructed lane. Outbound and return share a 24 Q4 per-target budget; at most three bounded objects and no through-wall return.","field_caps":["draw_ore"]},{"id":43,"name":"Warm Thread","phase":"fire","handler":"warm_thread","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"Draw a 40px ground thread after an 8-update warning; first crossing ends it. No through-wall segments.","field_caps":["store_heat"]},{"id":44,"name":"Coil Clamp","phase":"fire","handler":"coil_clamp","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Two hooked arcs close on a 32px pocket; a target is hit once across both arcs. The player can walk through.","field_caps":["store_heat"]},{"id":45,"name":"Crown Interval","phase":"fire","handler":"crown_interval","cooldown_updates":150,"effect":"Show three short spokes, then activate them in order; share a 32Q4 target budget across the whole cast. Gap remains visibly safe.","field_caps":["store_heat","ignite"]},{"id":46,"name":"Heel Knock","phase":"earth","handler":"heel_knock","cooldown_updates":90,"effect":"A narrow 22px stomp cone interrupts eligible ordinary foes; no boss displacement or terrain mutation.","field_caps":["press_weight"]},{"id":47,"name":"Brace Reply","phase":"earth","handler":"brace_reply","cooldown_updates":120,"effect":"Visible frontal bracing arc catches one eligible ordinary contact attack, then replies; expiry gives no damage and no invulnerability.","field_ca